        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1939-12-22/pdf/FR-1939-12-22.pdf"
      },
      "text": "S ec. 2. Subject to the conditions ex­\npressed in the above-mentioned acts, and\n14 F R . 2731 DI.\nto valid existing rights, the lands de­\nscribed in section 1 of this order are  \nhereby withdrawn and reserved for the  \nuse of the War Department for military  \npurposes."
    },
